d a record financial performance for FY26, driven by strong growth in the 2-wheeler and automotive lighting sectors alongside improving operating leverage. Management highlighted continuing demand for advanced LED lighting and shared updates on expanding 4-wheeler business initiatives, particularly with clients like Mahindra & Mahindra. The company also detailed strategic investments into renewable energy and a projected capex of around 200 crores over the next two years. Furthermore, the management reaffirmed its FY27 revenue growth expectations of 15% to 20% and a stable EBITDA margin target of around 14%. Fiem Industries Limited released its Q4 and FY26 earnings presentation, detailing its financial performance, corporate structure, and manufacturing capabilities across automotive lighting, rear-view mirrors, and other components.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"Management targets an EBITDA margin of around 14% for the full year.","quote":"So for the full year, we continue to maintain our guidance that we will be in the current margin, which is a 14% EBITDA plus is what we target for.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f1b6f5cd-7a1c-4bd0-a620-2c7307900223.pdf"},{"claim":"The company maintains an annualized revenue growth guidance of 15% to 20%.","quote":"We believe that the year and the subsequent year look okay, and we'll continue to maintain 15% to 20% growth.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f1b6f5cd-7a1c-4bd0-a620-2c7307900223.pdf"},{"claim":"The 4-wheeler business revenue is expected to be in the range of 100 crores to 150 crores for the current year.","quote":"if I have to give you a broad guidance for the year, our current 4-wheeler business would be in the range of INR100 crores to INR150 crores for the current year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f1b6f5cd-7a1c-4bd0-a620-2c7307900223.pdf"},{"claim":"The 4-wheeler business revenue is projected to move up to 200 crores to 250 crores for FY27-28.","quote":"And going forward, we definitely expect this to move up significantly faster to INR200 crores to INR250 crores for the FY27-28.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f1b6f5cd-7a1c-4bd0-a620-2c7307900223.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Production volumes for the 2-wheeler industry grew by about 12% to an all-time high of roughly 26.7 million units.","quote":"Production volumes for the year grew about 12% to an all-time high of roughly 26.7 million units.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f1b6f5cd-7a1c-4bd0-a620-2c7307900223.pdf"},{"claim":"Growth in the 2-wheeler industry was driven by improving rural demand, shift towards premium vehicles, and steady adoption of electric vehicles.","quote":"Growth was driven by improving rural demand, shift towards premium vehicles and the steady adoption of the electric vehicles.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f1b6f5cd-7a1c-4bd0-a620-2c7307900223.pdf"},{"claim":"Management remains confident about healthy underlying demand and the shift towards premium technology-rich vehicles.","quote":"The industries continue to benefit from healthy underlying demand, while the shift towards premium technology-rich vehicles align closely with our strength and capabilities, supported by a strong order book and a robust customer pipeline, we are well positioned for the next phase of the growth.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f1b6f5cd-7a1c-4bd0-a620-2c7307900223.pdf"},{"claim":"The Indian economy continued to demonstrate remarkable economic resilience and grew by 7.7% during FY 2025-26 according to Provisional Estimates.","quote":"According to the Provisional Estimates released by the National Statistics Office, India's real GDP grew by 7.7% during FY 2025\u201326.","doc_kind":"annual_report","doc_date":"2026-03-31","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=9c370dbe-ab3e-424e-8b00-44551b20d590.pdf"},{"claim":"Overall vehicle production increased by approximately 11.8% during FY 2025-26 according to SIAM.","quote":"According to SIAM, overall vehicle production increased by approximately 11.8% during FY 2025\u201326, with the two-wheeler industry surpassing its pre-pandemic peak to reach a record production of around 26.7 million units.","doc_kind":"annual_report","doc_date":"2026-03-31","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=9c370dbe-ab3e-424e-8b00-44551b20d590.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"The company made a capex of 108.31 crores during FY26.","quote":"During the year, the company has made a capex of INR108.31 crores.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f1b6f5cd-7a1c-4bd0-a620-2c7307900223.pdf"},{"claim":"The company has a projected capex of around 200 crores over the next 2 years.","quote":"We have a projected capex of INR200-odd crores over the next 2 years.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f1b6f5cd-7a1c-4bd0-a620-2c7307900223.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"The EBITDA margin for Q4 FY26 reached 14.67%.","quote":"The EBITDA in Q4 was INR109.18 crores translating into an EBITDA margin of 14.67% as compared to INR83.81 crores over the same quarter last year with EBITDA margin of 13.22%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f1b6f5cd-7a1c-4bd0-a620-2c7307900223.pdf"},{"claim":"Full year FY26 EBITDA stood at 393.34 crores translating into an EBITDA margin of 14.09%.","quote":"EBITDA stood at INR393.34 crores translating into an EBITDA margin of 14.09% as compared to INR320.73 crores during FY25, translating into an EBITDA margin of 13.34%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f1b6f5cd-7a1c-4bd0-a620-2c7307900223.pdf"},{"claim":"Price escalations from supply chain disruptions and input costs are passed on to customers.","quote":"So these are passed on this price escalations, any increase or decrease, both ways is passed on to the customer.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f1b6f5cd-7a1c-4bd0-a620-2c7307900223.pdf"},{"claim":"EBITDA reached a record Rs. 393.34 crore with an all-time high EBITDA margin of 14.09% reflecting operating leverage and manufacturing efficiencies.","quote":"EBITDA reached a record Rs.393.34 crore, with an all-time high EBITDA margin of 14.09%, reflecting operating leverage, manufacturing efficiencies and the benefits of our integrated production capabilities.","doc_kind":"annual_report","doc_date":"2026-03-31","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=9c370dbe-ab3e-424e-8b00-44551b20d590.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"LED lighting as a percentage of total automotive lighting stands at 63% for FY26.","quote":"As a percentage of total automotive lighting, the LED lighting stands at 60% (63%) in comparison to 60% during last 3 years.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f1b6f5cd-7a1c-4bd0-a620-2c7307900223.pdf"},{"claim":"Current capacity utilization is in the range of 75%.","quote":"Current capacity utilization is in the range of 75%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f1b6f5cd-7a1c-4bd0-a620-2c7307900223.pdf"},{"claim":"70% of the RFQs have been converted into business currently under development.","quote":"we have already converted 70% of those RFQs into a business and which will be under development right now.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f1b6f5cd-7a1c-4bd0-a620-2c7307900223.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"The Board recommended a final dividend of 400%, amounting to 40 per share totaling 105.28 crores.","quote":"I am also pleased to share that the Board has recommended a final dividend of 400%, that is INR40 per share amounting to INR105.28 crores.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f1b6f5cd-7a1c-4bd0-a620-2c7307900223.pdf"},{"claim":"The Board of Directors recommended a final dividend of Rs. 40 per equity share (400%) for FY 2025-26.","quote":"your Board of Directors has recommended a final dividend of Rs.40 per equity share (400%) for FY 2025\u201326, subject to your approval at the ensuing Annual General Meeting.","doc_kind":"annual_report","doc_date":"2026-03-31","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=9c370dbe-ab3e-424e-8b00-44551b20d590.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Geopolitical tension, currency fluctuations, and cost pressures shaped up the operating environment.","quote":"Geopolitical tension, currency fluctuations and cost pressures continue to shape up the operating environment for business across the world yet the Indian automotive industry remained resilient","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f1b6f5cd-7a1c-4bd0-a620-2c7307900223.pdf"},{"claim":"Supply chain disruption causes price escalations in a number of products.","quote":"there is this whole supply chain disruption, which may -- which is causing price escalations in a number of our products.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f1b6f5cd-7a1c-4bd0-a620-2c7307900223.pdf"},{"claim":"Geopolitical tensions arose from the conflict in West Asia during the period.","quote":"Despite heightened geopolitical tensions arising from the conflict in West Asia, India continued to demonstrate remarkable economic resilience and retained its position as one of the fastest-growing major economies in the world.","doc_kind":"annual_report","doc_date":"2026-03-31","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=9c370dbe-ab3e-424e-8b00-44551b20d590.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"Fiem Industries intends to roll out the solar and renewable energy model across all other plants over the coming years.","quote":"We intend to roll out this model across all our other plants over the coming years.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f1b6f5cd-7a1c-4bd0-a620-2c7307900223.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"The company expects its 4-wheeler business to reach 100 crores to 150 crores in the current year.","quote":"our current 4-wheeler business would be in the range of INR100 crores to INR150 crores for the current year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f1b6f5cd-7a1c-4bd0-a620-2c7307900223.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"Management expects 4-wheeler revenue to move up to 200 crores to 250 crores in FY27-28.","quote":"And going forward, we definitely expect this to move up significantly faster to INR200 crores to INR250 crores for the FY27-28.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f1b6f5cd-7a1c-4bd0-a620-2c7307900223.pdf","timeframe":"FY27-28"},{"claim":"The company targets to maintain its EBITDA margin at around 14% for the full year.","quote":"So for the full year, we continue to maintain our guidance that we will be in the current margin, which is a 14% EBITDA plus is what we target for.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f1b6f5cd-7a1c-4bd0-a620-2c7307900223.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"Management continues to maintain an annual revenue growth target of 15% to 20%.","quote":"We believe that the year and the subsequent year look okay, and we'll continue to maintain 15% to 20% growth.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f1b6f5cd-7a1c-4bd0-a620-2c7307900223.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"The consolidated EBITDA margin is expected to remain around 14% including the 4-wheeler business for the next 2, 3 years.","quote":"Overall, we can continue to guide even while we grow this business, it will be at neutral margins. This is the margin range that we think we can follow for the next 2, 3 years.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f1b6f5cd-7a1c-4bd0-a620-2c7307900223.pdf","timeframe":"next 2, 3 years"},{"claim":"The board recommended a final dividend of Rs. 40 per equity share for FY 2025-26 subject to shareholder approval.","quote":"your Board of Directors has recommended a final dividend of Rs.40 per equity share (400%) for FY 2025\u201326, subject to your approval at the ensuing Annual General Meeting.","doc_kind":"annual_report","doc_date":"2026-03-31","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=9c370dbe-ab3e-424e-8b00-44551b20d590.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_transcript","concall_ppt","annual_report"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":30,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":2,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}